WEBVTT

01:48.330 --> 01:53.000
<b>2nd Stage: Lv. 5
If you keep upgrading your initial equipment,
it'll usually become your most powerful weapon</b>

01:53.290 --> 01:54.800
<b>O-Oh, wow...</b>

01:54.800 --> 01:55.990
<b>How awful.</b>

01:55.990 --> 01:58.760
<b>Th-This was from you, Minmi.</b>

01:59.330 --> 02:00.490
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

02:01.630 --> 02:04.800
<b>Don't worry about it! 
I'll get you another one. Okay?</b>

02:05.420 --> 02:06.520
<b>But...</b>

02:06.520 --> 02:09.400
<b>It's fine! We'll be 
matching again in no time.</b>

02:09.400 --> 02:10.040
<b>Right?</b>

02:10.560 --> 02:15.660
<b>Yeah, but... still... I'm so sorry, Minmi.</b>

02:16.760 --> 02:18.780
<b>Really, really sorry.</b>

02:19.240 --> 02:20.180
<b>Tama...</b>

02:25.400 --> 02:26.560
<b>Tomozaki?</b>

02:27.860 --> 02:30.170
<b>You know...</b>

02:30.460 --> 02:36.700
<b>When I saw this, I was all ready to 
shout, to say, "Quit screwing around!"</b>

02:37.850 --> 02:38.670
<b>But...</b>

02:39.000 --> 02:42.140
<b>Everyone's been doing so 
much for me, you know?</b>

02:42.710 --> 02:44.640
<b>Coming up with all these ideas...</b>

02:45.160 --> 02:47.040
<b>I didn't want all that to be for nothing,</b>

02:47.610 --> 02:50.260
<b>so I just sucked it up.</b>

02:50.700 --> 02:51.830
<b>Yeah?</b>

02:52.720 --> 02:53.760
<b>You did good.</b>

02:53.760 --> 02:56.330
<b>It took everything I had.</b>

02:57.760 --> 02:58.630
<b>Still...</b>

03:01.210 --> 03:05.320
<b>I... I just want to run away.</b>

03:06.280 --> 03:07.200
<b>Tama...</b>

03:13.920 --> 03:14.660
<b>Fumiya.</b>

03:16.660 --> 03:18.700
<b>You sure that's the best move?</b>

03:19.620 --> 03:20.810
<b>Mizusawa...</b>

03:27.760 --> 03:29.680
<b>Right. Thanks.</b>

03:29.680 --> 03:31.720
<b>We don't have any proof, after all,</b>

03:33.730 --> 03:35.890
<b>and the ringleader's not around.</b>

03:37.010 --> 03:38.860
<b>Yeah... right.</b>

03:41.850 --> 03:42.860
<b>This is unacceptable.</b>

03:45.040 --> 03:46.060
<b>Aoi?</b>

03:46.740 --> 03:49.250
<b>Old AV Room</b>

03:58.720 --> 04:00.890
<b>Erika's gone too far.</b>

04:02.480 --> 04:05.390
<b>I'm so sorry I couldn't do anything, Tama.</b>

04:05.390 --> 04:07.560
<b>Thanks, everyone.</b>

04:08.610 --> 04:09.600
<b>And I'm sorry.</b>

04:09.600 --> 04:12.270
<b><i>You</i> don't need to apologize for anything!</b>

04:15.270 --> 04:17.040
<b>H-Hey, I know!</b>

04:17.040 --> 04:20.230
<b>I've been knitting and sewing a lot lately—</b>

04:20.230 --> 04:22.240
<b>I bet I can fix this right up!</b>

04:22.720 --> 04:26.720
<b>Thanks. I'll take you up on that.</b>

04:26.720 --> 04:28.740
<b>Okay! Leave it to me!</b>

04:28.740 --> 04:31.730
<b>Let's see... take this here and...</b>

04:31.730 --> 04:34.000
<b>Whoa, are you sure?</b>

04:34.000 --> 04:38.750
<b>O-Oh, definitely! I've already 
made tissue covers and stuff.</b>

04:38.750 --> 04:42.170
<b>Tissue covers? That sounds pretty... simple.</b>

04:42.590 --> 04:44.010
<b>B-Busted...</b>

04:47.890 --> 04:52.770
<b>Let's stay with Hanabi as 
much as we can for now.</b>

04:53.210 --> 04:55.140
<b>We don't know what might happen.</b>

04:55.580 --> 04:57.240
<b>You got it.</b>

04:57.770 --> 04:59.770
<b>Tomozaki</b>

05:04.640 --> 05:07.780
<b>What the heck is <i>this</i> all about?</b>

05:08.580 --> 05:11.160
<b>Oh, y'know...</b>

05:47.320 --> 05:48.720
<b>What the hell?</b>

05:48.720 --> 05:52.130
<b>Who did this to my desk?</b>

05:54.460 --> 05:56.040
<b>It had to be Hanabi.</b>

05:57.570 --> 05:59.920
<b>Hanabi's been with me all day.</b>

06:00.180 --> 06:03.430
<b>Excuse me? What's it to <i>you</i>, Aoi?</b>

06:03.430 --> 06:06.260
<b>Because I can prove Hanabi didn't do it.</b>

06:06.510 --> 06:09.760
<b><i>Plenty of people would have 
seen her with me, too.</i></b>

06:11.660 --> 06:12.390
<b><i>Well</i>, then!</b>

06:12.880 --> 06:13.740
<b>In that case...</b>

06:14.640 --> 06:16.140
<b>it must have been <i>you</i>, Mao.</b>

06:17.990 --> 06:22.000
<b>No! Why would it be me? <i>I</i> didn't do it.</b>

06:22.000 --> 06:23.150
<b>Then who did?</b>

06:23.860 --> 06:24.900
<b>You, that's who.</b>

06:26.260 --> 06:31.160
<b>Where do you get off accusing 
me without any proof?</b>

06:31.870 --> 06:32.660
<b>Huh?</b>

06:33.370 --> 06:36.400
<b>Jeez, assume much? Who do you think you are?</b>

06:36.400 --> 06:37.910
<b>M-Mao!</b>

06:39.950 --> 06:41.920
<b>Why the sudden attitude?</b>

06:41.920 --> 06:45.000
<b><i>You've been sketchy as hell lately.</i></b>

06:45.000 --> 06:46.670
<b>Me, "sketchy"?</b>

06:46.670 --> 06:52.230
<b>You're all distant. You're off 
having fun somewhere else!</b>

06:52.230 --> 06:54.010
<b>What are you <i>talking</i> about?</b>

06:57.300 --> 07:01.190
<b>Besides, I can do what I want, can't I?</b>

07:01.510 --> 07:04.190
<b>Oh, so it's like <i>that</i>?</b>

07:04.190 --> 07:06.170
<b>You're sick of us teasing you,</b>

07:06.170 --> 07:09.450
<b>so you thought you'd jump 
ship to another group, huh?</b>

07:09.780 --> 07:11.910
<b>How lame is that?</b>

07:11.910 --> 07:15.450
<b>Watch yourself—your lameness 
is written all over your face.</b>

07:17.770 --> 07:21.230
<b>Well, <i>you're</i> the one who looks 
like some stupid middle-schooler</b>

07:21.230 --> 07:23.670
<b>with that dumb black off-the-shoulder 
thing you always wear.</b>

07:23.670 --> 07:25.130
<b>Why don't you give it a rest?</b>

07:35.060 --> 07:36.640
<b>What did you just say to me, Mao?</b>

07:40.940 --> 07:44.730
<b>I <i>said</i> that off-the-shoulder thing 
you always wear is stupid and lame.</b>

07:48.190 --> 07:51.700
<b>And you suck at putting on lashes.</b>

07:52.090 --> 07:54.740
<b>They look all fake and crappy again today.</b>

07:54.740 --> 07:56.500
<b>That's enough out of you!</b>

07:58.700 --> 07:59.830
<b>Ow!</b>

08:04.040 --> 08:06.430
<b>She's a real stickler about 
clothes and fashion—</b>

08:06.430 --> 08:10.380
<b>she'd probably step it up if I promised 
her pricey cosmetics when we win.</b>

08:10.880 --> 08:16.350
<b>I think she <i>really</i> doesn't want people 
to look down on her. That motivates her.</b>

08:16.640 --> 08:18.840
<b><i>Such a pinpoint attack...</i></b>

08:29.690 --> 08:32.190
<b>Mao... are you okay?</b>

08:32.470 --> 08:33.540
<b>What's wrong?</b>

08:33.540 --> 08:34.950
<b>Did something happen?</b>

08:34.950 --> 08:35.950
<b>What's with Mao?</b>

08:35.950 --> 08:37.200
<b>Erika's desk?</b>

08:37.200 --> 08:38.370
<b>Seriously?</b>

08:38.370 --> 08:38.880
<b>A fight?</b>

08:38.880 --> 08:43.220
<b><i>With this mood, she'll have 
to apologize—or else.</i></b>

08:45.630 --> 08:46.460
<b>Um...</b>

08:46.840 --> 08:48.960
<b>Mao? Uh...</b>

08:49.190 --> 08:52.460
<b><i>That's the class queen for you: 
ultra-sensitive to the mood.</i></b>

08:52.730 --> 08:53.970
<b>Apologize.</b>

08:57.990 --> 08:59.720
<b>Apologize, Erika.</b>

09:00.000 --> 09:02.460
<b>What? To <i>her</i>?!</b>

09:02.460 --> 09:04.690
<b>Jeez. You're unbelievable.</b>

09:05.360 --> 09:08.060
<b>No—I was just—</b>

09:08.380 --> 09:11.410
<b>Erika... that was uncalled for.</b>

09:12.070 --> 09:14.950
<b><i>I know it was in the heat of the moment,</i></b>

09:15.220 --> 09:17.560
<b>but not apologizing just isn't right.</b>

09:18.390 --> 09:20.920
<b>Yeah, that <i>was</i> uncalled for.</b>

09:20.920 --> 09:22.950
<b>Erika really is in the wrong here.</b>

09:24.740 --> 09:26.050
<b>Kinda sours me on her.</b>

09:26.050 --> 09:27.670
<b>How hard is it to say she's sorry?</b>

09:27.950 --> 09:30.670
<b>I've never seen her apologize before, so...</b>

09:33.790 --> 09:34.920
<b><i>The mood—</i></b>

09:37.040 --> 09:38.360
<b><i>it's being manipulated.</i></b>

09:39.410 --> 09:41.330
<b>I'm against violence!</b>

09:42.430 --> 09:45.220
<b>Huh? That was an accident.</b>

09:45.220 --> 09:46.960
<b>Don't you know what "violence" means?</b>

09:46.960 --> 09:48.150
<b>Tell them, Mika.</b>

09:49.560 --> 09:51.020
<b>B-Beats me...</b>

09:52.380 --> 09:54.650
<b>Aren't <i>you</i> the one who doesn't 
know the meaning of the word?</b>

09:54.650 --> 09:55.900
<b>No kidding.</b>

09:55.900 --> 09:58.790
<b>Then what Natsubayashi did 
wasn't violence, either.</b>

09:59.260 --> 10:03.410
<b><i>The class will automatically 
start judging Konno.</i></b>

10:04.630 --> 10:06.780
<b><i>As a shallow excuse for punishment...</i></b>

10:08.660 --> 10:10.060
<b><i>This will settle it.</i></b>

10:10.060 --> 10:11.170
<b>Still...</b>

10:13.660 --> 10:15.500
<b>Don't you think she has to apologize?</b>

10:16.650 --> 10:17.630
<b>Totally.</b>

10:18.820 --> 10:23.100
<b>C'mon, Erika. All of this 
has been your fault.</b>

10:23.360 --> 10:24.930
<b>Just apologize already.</b>

10:27.090 --> 10:28.130
<b>That just now—</b>

10:29.080 --> 10:31.060
<b>Don't you think she has to apologize?</b>

10:31.580 --> 10:34.520
<b><i>Was she looking at Nakamura?</i></b>

10:35.230 --> 10:38.530
<b>Apologize now and Mao will forgive you, too.</b>

10:38.530 --> 10:39.280
<b>Right?</b>

10:40.030 --> 10:42.070
<b><i>This time it was Izumi.</i></b>

10:42.070 --> 10:43.410
<b>That's right, Erika.</b>

10:45.670 --> 10:46.410
<b><i>I knew it.</i></b>

10:47.030 --> 10:50.420
<b>She knows it was in the heat of the moment.</b>

10:50.420 --> 10:52.670
<b><i>No... their words contain...</i></b>

10:52.890 --> 10:55.270
<b>Apologize to each other and you'll be square.</b>

10:55.270 --> 10:56.170
<b><i>...a reversal spell...</i></b>

10:56.530 --> 10:58.160
<b>Yeah, Erika.</b>

10:58.160 --> 10:59.680
<b><i>...cast by the demon queen!</i></b>

11:02.950 --> 11:06.180
<b>What gives? What <i>is</i> it with you two?</b>

11:06.400 --> 11:09.440
<b>Don't get so cocky just 
because you're a <i>thing</i> now.</b>

11:09.440 --> 11:11.190
<b>E-Erika?</b>

11:11.520 --> 11:13.190
<b><i>It's basically like this:</i></b>

11:13.600 --> 11:17.400
<b><i>Hinami called on Nakamura and Izumi in turn</i></b>

11:17.400 --> 11:21.520
<b><i>and they both agreed with her.</i></b>

11:21.520 --> 11:23.200
<b><i>That's all.</i></b>

11:23.700 --> 11:25.450
<b><i>But to Konno...</i></b>

11:25.930 --> 11:29.710
<b><i>It probably looked like the 
two were ganging up on her</i></b>

11:30.050 --> 11:31.290
<b><i>as a couple.</i></b>

11:32.130 --> 11:35.340
<b>See? They're both saying it, too.</b>

11:35.860 --> 11:40.720
<b>Why don't you get a room already?
It's disgusting.</b>

11:41.050 --> 11:43.070
<b>Get a room?</b>

11:43.720 --> 11:45.110
<b>Where'd <i>that</i> come from?</b>

11:45.110 --> 11:46.220
<b>Jealous much?</b>

11:47.830 --> 11:51.800
<b>Look, you guys are totally beyond lame.</b>

11:51.800 --> 11:53.940
<b>Just because you started dating doesn't mean</b>

11:53.940 --> 11:56.940
<b>you get to hold hands and dogpile me.</b>

11:56.940 --> 11:58.530
<b>It's just mean!</b>

11:59.360 --> 12:01.120
<b>What the hell... Seriously...</b>

12:01.920 --> 12:05.670
<b>Quit... Quit making fun of me already!</b>

12:06.700 --> 12:09.930
<b>You can date whoever you want, okay?</b>

12:10.830 --> 12:16.960
<b>But going on about how <i>perfect</i> you 
are for each other is just gross!</b>

12:16.960 --> 12:19.510
<b><i>The illusion that the demon queen had spun</i></b>

12:19.510 --> 12:21.910
<b><i>was visible only to Erika Konno.</i></b>

12:21.910 --> 12:22.720
<b><i>Which meant...</i></b>

12:23.200 --> 12:24.170
<b>What?</b>

12:24.170 --> 12:24.970
<b>Dunno.</b>

12:25.200 --> 12:26.560
<b>Now <i>that's</i> a victim complex.</b>

12:26.560 --> 12:27.470
<b>Right?</b>

12:29.280 --> 12:33.450
<b>Are you two seriously, like, twelve?</b>

12:33.450 --> 12:34.890
<b>Erika...</b>

12:34.890 --> 12:39.860
<b>I get how you feel, but these two 
don't mean to make fun of you.</b>

12:40.190 --> 12:43.610
<b>I think maybe you're losing 
perspective, Erika.</b>

12:44.110 --> 12:46.320
<b>You're getting carried away 
with this crush of yours.</b>

12:49.090 --> 12:52.770
<b>I get it. That kind of 
thing happens to me, too.</b>

12:52.770 --> 12:55.450
<b>But try to calm down for a sec. Okay?</b>

12:55.960 --> 12:58.210
<b><i>Why even go there?</i></b>

12:58.510 --> 13:01.210
<b>But I... I don't...</b>

13:01.570 --> 13:02.350
<b>Hinami.</b>

13:10.100 --> 13:14.220
<b>Well! That's the end of <i>that</i>!</b>

13:14.220 --> 13:16.580
<b>Sorry for saying all that weird stuff.</b>

13:16.580 --> 13:19.150
<b>I don't think we can speak calmly right now,</b>

13:19.150 --> 13:22.440
<b>so let's talk later, when we're 
not raring for a fight.</b>

13:22.440 --> 13:24.950
<b>C'mon, wipe your tears.</b>

13:24.950 --> 13:26.880
<b>Tissues, tissues...</b>

13:28.130 --> 13:30.500
<b>Sorry, Shuji—can I have a tissue?</b>

13:30.500 --> 13:31.990
<b>Yeah, sure.</b>

13:31.990 --> 13:33.250
<b>No problem.</b>

13:33.540 --> 13:36.830
<b>I've already made tissue covers and stuff.</b>

13:40.810 --> 13:42.090
<b>Here you go, Erika.</b>

13:55.060 --> 13:56.070
<b>Whoa...</b>

13:56.070 --> 13:57.740
<b>Did she just...?</b>

13:57.740 --> 13:59.360
<b>No—wait—</b>

13:59.360 --> 14:01.010
<b>Unbelievable.</b>

14:01.010 --> 14:04.190
<b>You know, I've always 
thought she was selfish.</b>

14:04.190 --> 14:07.020
<b>Always going around acting 
like she's the queen.</b>

14:07.020 --> 14:07.910
<b>No...</b>

14:08.950 --> 14:09.950
<b>That was—</b>

14:09.950 --> 14:11.730
<b><i>She's been crying for a while now.</i></b>

14:11.730 --> 14:14.380
<b><i>Is she going for sympathy points?</i></b>

14:14.380 --> 14:15.630
<b><i>Seriously!</i></b>

14:15.630 --> 14:19.640
<b><i>Lashing out just because the 
guy you like is taken...</i></b>

14:19.640 --> 14:21.190
<b><i>That's so lame!</i></b>

14:23.350 --> 14:24.880
<b>Serves you right.</b>

14:30.320 --> 14:31.970
<b>Oops, sorry.</b>

14:32.390 --> 14:33.970
<b>It was an <i>accident</i>.</b>

14:34.890 --> 14:38.100
<b><i>The mood... the norm for good or bad...</i></b>

14:38.100 --> 14:39.480
<b><i>had flipped.</i></b>

14:39.980 --> 14:40.480
<b>Whoops!</b>

14:40.480 --> 14:41.940
<b>An <i>accident</i>.</b>

14:41.940 --> 14:43.480
<b>Me, too—an <i>accident</i>.</b>

14:55.490 --> 14:57.860
<b><i>At this rate, there's no one who can—</i></b>

14:57.860 --> 14:58.780
<b>Hey!</b>

14:59.250 --> 15:02.370
<b>Just because Konno did it doesn't 
mean you can do it back.</b>

15:02.370 --> 15:04.880
<b>It's just as wrong when <i>you</i> do it!</b>

15:07.140 --> 15:09.380
<b><i>This is too righteous.</i></b>

15:10.020 --> 15:12.310
<b><i>With the class mood as it stands now...</i></b>

15:12.310 --> 15:16.140
<b>You can't just gang up and 
attack people like that!</b>

15:16.750 --> 15:17.850
<b>Knock it off!</b>

15:18.080 --> 15:19.950
<b><i>...it might not fly.</i></b>

15:20.320 --> 15:24.610
<b>Let's end this on good terms 
and have a fresh start.</b>

15:25.070 --> 15:26.780
<b><i>Tama</i>-rrow is another day!</b>

15:31.770 --> 15:34.050
<b>You're amazing, Hanabi!</b>

15:35.060 --> 15:37.620
<b>She really is! I didn't see that coming.</b>

15:37.620 --> 15:40.250
<b><i>But y'know, she could be right.</i></b>

15:40.640 --> 15:44.600
<b>I mean, if the main victim 
says we should stop...</b>

15:44.600 --> 15:46.750
<b>I guess we'd better stop.</b>

15:50.080 --> 15:51.260
<b>Erika!</b>

15:54.150 --> 15:56.350
<b>That was <i>so cool</i>, Tama!</b>

16:07.880 --> 16:10.120
<b>I'm sorry, Natsubayashi.</b>

16:10.120 --> 16:11.400
<b>For everything.</b>

16:13.050 --> 16:14.660
<b>Eh. It's fine.</b>

16:15.120 --> 16:17.660
<b>But I'm not the only one you need to talk to.</b>

16:20.720 --> 16:23.370
<b>Um, Hirabayashi... I'm sorry.</b>

16:23.370 --> 16:24.420
<b>Me, too.</b>

16:24.750 --> 16:25.720
<b>Oh, uh...</b>

16:26.970 --> 16:27.920
<b>O-Okay.</b>

16:28.330 --> 16:29.920
<b>That's all right.</b>

16:30.220 --> 16:35.220
<b>Thanks, Hanabi. I don't think I could
 have quelled that on my own.</b>

16:35.220 --> 16:39.680
<b>Thank <i>you</i>, Aoi—for fighting for me.</b>

16:39.680 --> 16:42.410
<b>You fought plenty hard yourself.</b>

16:42.410 --> 16:43.310
<b><i>Yeah...</i></b>

16:44.320 --> 16:50.070
<b>But I kinda didn't want to 
see you doing that, Aoi.</b>

16:50.390 --> 16:51.900
<b>Hmm? Doing what?</b>

16:54.360 --> 16:55.160
<b>I just...</b>

16:56.250 --> 16:57.740
<b>I really didn't.</b>

16:58.910 --> 17:00.910
<b>Bottom-Tier Character Tomozaki S2</b>

17:03.080 --> 17:07.850
<b>I... I made Aoi do something terrible.</b>

17:08.340 --> 17:10.320
<b>You talking about what Hinami did?</b>

17:10.320 --> 17:11.340
<b>Yeah...</b>

17:11.680 --> 17:15.150
<b>She was really angry.</b>

17:16.870 --> 17:18.930
<b>It was shocking, yeah.</b>

17:19.560 --> 17:22.850
<b>I'm pretty sure Aoi didn't 
<i>want</i> to do what she did.</b>

17:23.540 --> 17:25.100
<b>But because of me...</b>

17:26.560 --> 17:27.600
<b><i>I thought</i></b>

17:27.600 --> 17:32.840
<b><i>Tama had picked up on Hinami's ulterior 
motives and was disappointed in her.</i></b>

17:33.610 --> 17:34.340
<b><i>But...</i></b>

17:35.120 --> 17:37.360
<b>You trust Hinami, don't you?</b>

17:40.350 --> 17:42.660
<b>Thanks for everything—both of you.</b>

17:42.660 --> 17:44.750
<b>I gotta get to my club meeting!</b>

17:45.670 --> 17:48.200
<b>Tama's half right.</b>

17:48.200 --> 17:49.400
<b>Is that about the shape of it?</b>

17:49.850 --> 17:51.610
<b>Yeah... pretty much.</b>

17:52.360 --> 17:53.760
<b>The way I see it,</b>

17:54.620 --> 18:00.140
<b>I'm someone who can spot the parts 
of Aoi that she hides inside herself.</b>

18:00.850 --> 18:04.220
<b>You probably know about 
those better than I do.</b>

18:06.230 --> 18:07.730
<b>Well...</b>

18:09.250 --> 18:12.230
<b>Ah, never mind. Even if you did,</b>

18:12.230 --> 18:14.930
<b>it wouldn't be fair of me to ask.</b>

18:15.620 --> 18:18.830
<b>The team's taught me something lately, too.</b>

18:19.320 --> 18:22.240
<b>How to come right out and 
say what's on your mind.</b>

18:22.800 --> 18:27.210
<b>So I'm just gonna say what I'm thinking:</b>

18:33.090 --> 18:34.730
<b>I like Aoi.</b>

18:35.340 --> 18:38.810
<b>What do <i>you</i> think of her?</b>

18:44.490 --> 18:46.220
<b><i>It was several days later.</i></b>

18:46.740 --> 18:53.230
<b><i>The animosity toward Konno had gradually 
dissipated after Tama's scolding.</i></b>

18:53.590 --> 18:57.190
<b><i>She didn't take back her throne at 
the top of the class, of course,</i></b>

18:58.240 --> 19:04.740
<b><i>but Izumi's efforts and Konno's 
naturally strong communication skills</i></b>

19:04.740 --> 19:08.160
<b><i>restored her to a perfectly 
respectable standing.</i></b>

19:08.160 --> 19:11.900
<b><i>The rest is up to Konno's maneuvering.</i></b>

19:12.410 --> 19:15.920
<b><i>And how did Tama fare in all this?</i></b>

19:16.380 --> 19:20.130
<b><i>Simply put, she gained 
a bunch of new friends.</i></b>

19:20.370 --> 19:22.640
<b>Tama! We've <i>gotta</i> try karaoke sometime!</b>

19:22.640 --> 19:25.140
<b>Mmm, I'm not big on karaoke.</b>

19:26.510 --> 19:28.480
<b>You're so honest!</b>

19:28.480 --> 19:31.240
<b><i>Whenever Tama came right out with an opinion,</i></b>

19:31.240 --> 19:35.400
<b><i>people got a kick out of it: 
"That's Tama for you!"</i></b>

19:35.610 --> 19:38.150
<b>But I'll go if Minmi is coming.</b>

19:38.150 --> 19:39.400
<b>What the—?!</b>

19:39.400 --> 19:41.990
<b>I'm feeling the love!</b>

19:40.120 --> 19:42.910
<b>Hey, Minmi! Back off!</b>

19:43.200 --> 19:46.280
<b>You sure do love Mimimi, don't you, Tama?</b>

19:46.710 --> 19:51.040
<b>N-No I don't! It just <i>looks</i> 
that way 'cause I'm so small!</b>

19:51.450 --> 19:55.040
<b>Huh? What's your size got to do with it?</b>

19:57.280 --> 19:58.550
<b>I-I mean...</b>

19:58.550 --> 20:02.050
<b>Oh my gosh! Just look at you blush!</b>

20:02.640 --> 20:05.010
<b>A-<i>dor</i>-a-ble!</b>

20:05.300 --> 20:07.960
<b>Hey! Hands off my Tama!</b>

20:07.960 --> 20:09.660
<b>Aw, c'mon...</b>

20:09.660 --> 20:11.340
<b>I'm not yours either, though, Minmi.</b>

20:11.340 --> 20:12.020
<b>What?!</b>

20:12.020 --> 20:17.020
<b><i>This is "the class being used 
to her character" in a nutshell.</i></b>

20:18.200 --> 20:22.490
<b><i>At any rate, her relationship 
with Nakamura improved, too.</i></b>

20:22.490 --> 20:25.280
<b>Huh? What about you, Hanabi?</b>

20:25.760 --> 20:27.800
<b>I'm firmly in the downtown camp.</b>

20:27.800 --> 20:30.490
<b>Let the guys go to the 
soccer game without us!</b>

20:30.490 --> 20:33.550
<b><i>Man, you really are stubborn, aren't you?</i></b>

20:33.550 --> 20:35.330
<b>Oh, like you <i>aren't</i>?</b>

20:36.620 --> 20:41.340
<b><i>As Mizusawa suggested, it's not 
like Nakamura truly hated her.</i></b>

20:41.340 --> 20:44.720
<b><i>I think he just wanted 
a reason to forgive her.</i></b>

20:45.710 --> 20:49.530
<b><i>Difficult stuff. Human relationships 
are so complicated.</i></b>

20:51.550 --> 20:54.270
<b>Okay, everyone, listen up!</b>

20:54.640 --> 20:59.520
<b>Now, I've gathered you all here 
today for one big reason...</b>

20:59.520 --> 21:01.290
<b>Ooh, are they ready?</b>

21:01.290 --> 21:02.530
<b>Finally!</b>

21:02.760 --> 21:05.910
<b>Ta-dah! Reinforcements!</b>

21:06.640 --> 21:07.910
<b>Reinforcements?</b>

21:12.710 --> 21:13.960
<b>Are these...?</b>

21:17.060 --> 21:19.240
<b>Check <i>this</i> out!</b>

21:26.580 --> 21:29.850
<b>Now we're all set!</b>

21:31.490 --> 21:34.890
<b>Tomozaki, I bet you're the 
one who came up with this.</b>

21:35.160 --> 21:39.400
<b>You got me. At least now we all match, right?</b>

21:39.690 --> 21:41.990
<b>Oh, Tomozaki, you're such a dum-dum.</b>

21:41.990 --> 21:43.900
<b>But... thanks!</b>

21:44.150 --> 21:45.000
<b>Yep.</b>

21:45.000 --> 21:47.120
<b>I worked hard to sew those!</b>

21:47.120 --> 21:49.400
<b>It's kinda coming apart here, though.</b>

21:49.400 --> 21:50.400
<b>What?! No way!</b>

21:50.400 --> 21:51.520
<b>Kidding.</b>

21:51.520 --> 21:53.490
<b><i>L-Lying</i>, you mean.</b>

21:53.490 --> 21:55.360
<b>Cut it out!</b>

21:56.040 --> 21:57.160
<b>Okay, okay.</b>

21:57.160 --> 21:59.190
<b>That's enough flirting, you two.</b>

21:59.190 --> 22:01.280
<b>We're not flirting!</b>

21:59.190 --> 22:01.280
<b>But we're not flirting!</b>

22:05.040 --> 22:08.300
<b>They're kind of pretty all laid out like this.</b>

22:08.670 --> 22:09.720
<b>Yeah, they are.</b>

22:10.330 --> 22:13.420
<b>Such a colorful circle—sorta like...</b>

22:13.880 --> 22:15.300
<b>like fireworks!</b>

22:16.820 --> 22:18.540
<b><i>"Hanabi"—get it?</i></b>

22:18.540 --> 22:20.730
<b>Hey, don't steal my line!</b>

22:22.370 --> 22:25.530
<b><i>Since we're all here, let's take a picture!</i></b>

22:25.530 --> 22:26.560
<b><i>Hey, yeah.</i></b>

22:26.560 --> 22:28.790
<b>Yes! To show our friendship!</b>

22:28.790 --> 22:31.250
<b>Let's do it! Let's do it!</b>

22:32.440 --> 22:34.320
<b>Say "cheese"!</b>

22:34.320 --> 22:36.150
<b><i>Tamaya</i>!</b>

22:48.250 --> 22:50.350
<b><i>A thought occurred to me...</i></b>

22:51.260 --> 22:54.720
<b><i>about the cruel way Hinami 
brought Konno down a peg.</i></b>

22:54.720 --> 22:56.720
<b><i>Make no mistake:</i></b>

22:56.720 --> 22:58.980
<b><i>That wasn't some spur-of-the-moment thing.</i></b>

22:58.980 --> 23:01.480
<b><i>It was premeditated malice, a plan carefully</i></b>

23:01.480 --> 23:05.370
<b><i>constructed in advance to hurt 
Konno—deeply and completely.</i></b>

23:06.590 --> 23:11.440
<b><i>Maybe because I've been acting on my 
trust in her as her student so far,</i></b>

23:12.650 --> 23:18.060
<b><i>but part of me thought she 
couldn't </i>really<i> be like that...</i></b>

23:19.440 --> 23:23.080
<b>What do <i>you</i> think of her?</b>

23:23.840 --> 23:25.850
<b><i>My answer to Miyazawa's question?</i></b>

23:26.960 --> 23:32.030
<b><i>She's the teacher who brought 
color to this game of life.</i></b>

23:33.190 --> 23:36.970
<b><i>I'd like to know Aoi Hinami better.</i></b>

23:37.600 --> 23:38.890
<b><i></i>That's<i> what I thought of her.</i></b>
